{"originalLanguage":"en","title":"Popular","artist":"Stephen Schwartz","date":"2026-07-28","sourceId":"14411850:026","sourceHash":"9334bfdbdce3c29bb99b1e3d6084fd2a41d30ef08b167bba1e812515878c433b","duration":218.0,"cues":[{"id":"1","start":28.66,"end":32.45,"text":"And even in your case","translation":"너 같은 경우에도 말이야","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"2","start":32.45,"end":37.47,"text":"Though it's the toughest case I've yet to face,","translation":"지금까지 만난 가장 어려운 경우지만","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"3","start":37.47,"end":41.97,"text":"Don't worry, I'm determined to succeed","translation":"걱정 마 꼭 성공하고 말 테니까","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"4","start":42.05,"end":53.07,"text":"Follow my lead, and yes, indeed, you will be...","translation":"날 따라와 그래 분명 너는 곧","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"5","start":53.07,"end":56.01,"text":"Popular!","translation":"인기인이 될 거야","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"6","start":56.28,"end":58.12,"text":"You're gonna be popular!","translation":"넌 인기인이 될 거야","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"7","start":58.12,"end":61.4,"text":"I'll teach you the proper ploys","translation":"남자애들과 말할 때 쓸 요령을","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"8","start":61.4,"end":62.6,"text":"When you talk to boys","translation":"제대로 가르쳐 줄게","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"9","start":62.6,"end":64.52,"text":"Little ways to flirt and flounce","translation":"살짝 유혹하고 멋 부리는 방법도","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"10","start":64.52,"end":66.58,"text":"Oooh! I'll show you what shoes to wear","translation":"어떤 신발을 신어야 할지 보여 줄게","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"11","start":66.58,"end":68.04,"text":"How to fix your hair","translation":"머리는 어떻게 해야 할지","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"12","start":68.04,"end":70.96,"text":"Everything that really counts to be...","translation":"정말 중요한 건 전부 다 인기인이 되는 것","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"13","start":70.96,"end":71.42,"text":"Popular!","translation":"인기인이 되는 것","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"14","start":71.42,"end":74.82,"text":"I'll help you be popular!","translation":"네가 인기인이 되도록 도와줄게","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"15","start":75.08,"end":77.74,"text":"You'll hang with the right cohorts","translation":"잘나가는 친구들과 어울리고","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"16","start":77.74,"end":78.88,"text":"You'll be good at sports","translation":"운동도 잘하게 될 거야","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"17","start":78.88,"end":80.82,"text":"Know the slang you've got to know","translation":"꼭 알아야 할 유행어도 익히고","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"18","start":80.82,"end":82.67,"text":"So let's start","translation":"그러니 시작하자","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"19","start":82.67,"end":85.36,"text":"'Cause you've got an awfully long way to go...","translation":"갈 길이 아주 멀거든","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"20","start":85.36,"end":89.62,"text":"Don't be offended by my frank analysis","translation":"내 솔직한 분석에 기분 나빠하지 마","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"21","start":89.62,"end":92.78,"text":"Think of it as personality dialysis","translation":"성격을 투석하는 거라 생각해","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"22","start":92.78,"end":96.74,"text":"Now that I've chosen to become a pal, sister and adviser","translation":"내가 친구이자 자매이자 조언자가 되기로 했으니","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"23","start":96.74,"end":98.11,"text":"There's nobody wiser","translation":"나보다 현명한 사람은 없어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"24","start":98.11,"end":99.55,"text":"Not when it comes to...","translation":"인기에 관해서라면 말이지","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"25","start":99.55,"end":100.35,"text":"Popular","translation":"인기","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"26","start":100.35,"end":103.51,"text":"I know about popular","translation":"난 인기에 대해 잘 알아","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"27","start":103.51,"end":105.93,"text":"And with an assist from me","translation":"내가 조금만 도와주면","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"28","start":105.93,"end":107.29,"text":"To be who you'll be","translation":"넌 네가 될 모습이 될 거야","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"29","start":107.29,"end":110.29,"text":"Instead of dreary, who you were... well, are","translation":"침울했던 예전의 너 대신 말이야 아직 그렇긴 하지만","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"30","start":110.29,"end":112.13,"text":"There's nothing that can stop you","translation":"그 무엇도 널 막을 수 없어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"31","start":112.13,"end":114.509,"text":"From becoming popu-ler... lar...","translation":"인기인이 되는 걸","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"32","start":114.509206,"end":120.509,"text":"La la, la la!","translation":"라라 라라","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"33","start":120.92,"end":123.7,"text":"We're gonna make you pop-u-lar...","translation":"널 인기인으로 만들 거야","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"34","start":126.34,"end":129.1,"text":"When I see depressing creatures","translation":"우울해 보이는 사람들을 보면","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"35","start":129.1,"end":131.58,"text":"With unprepossessing features","translation":"매력적이지 않은 생김새를 가진 사람들","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"36","start":131.58,"end":137.322812,"text":"I remind them on their own behalf to think of","translation":"그들 자신을 위해 떠올려 보라 말해","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"37","start":137.322812,"end":140.08,"text":"Celebrated heads of state","translation":"이름난 국가 지도자들이나","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"38","start":140.08,"end":142.88,"text":"Or 'specially great communicators","translation":"특별히 위대한 소통가들을","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"39","start":142.88,"end":145.76,"text":"Did they have brains or knowledge?","translation":"그들에게 두뇌나 지식이 있었을까","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"40","start":145.86,"end":147.54,"text":"Don't make me laugh!","translation":"웃기지 마","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"41","start":147.54,"end":149.48,"text":"They were popular!","translation":"그들은 인기 있었어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"42","start":150.12,"end":151.76,"text":"Please, it's all about popular!","translation":"제발 중요한 건 모두 인기야","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"43","start":151.76,"end":154.9,"text":"It's not about aptitude","translation":"재능의 문제가 아니야","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"44","start":154.9,"end":156.26,"text":"It's the way you're viewed","translation":"사람들에게 어떻게 보이느냐야","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"45","start":156.26,"end":158.36,"text":"So it's very shrewd to be","translation":"그러니 아주 영리한 선택은","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"46","start":158.36,"end":162.34,"text":"Very, very popular like me!","translation":"나처럼 아주 아주 인기인이 되는 것","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"47","start":162.34,"end":171.744,"text":"Why, Miss Elphaba, look at you. You're beautiful!","translation":"세상에 엘파바 양 너 좀 봐 정말 아름다워","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"48","start":177.17,"end":182.8,"text":"And though you protest","translation":"네가 반발하고","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"49","start":182.8,"end":185.24,"text":"Your disinterest","translation":"관심 없는 척해도","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"50","start":185.24,"end":189.46,"text":"I know clandestinely","translation":"난 남몰래 알고 있어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"51","start":192.68,"end":194.2,"text":"You're gonna grin and bear it","translation":"넌 웃으며 참아 내게 될 거야","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"52","start":194.2,"end":195.54,"text":"Your new found popularity","translation":"새로 얻은 인기와 함께","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"53","start":199.22,"end":200.1,"text":"Ohh!","translation":"오","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"54","start":200.1,"end":200.98,"text":"La la, la la!","translation":"라라 라라","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"55","start":200.98,"end":205.36,"text":"You'll be popular","translation":"넌 인기인이 될 거야","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"56","start":206.28,"end":209.06,"text":"Just not quite as popular as me!","translation":"그저 나만큼 인기 있지는 않겠지만","kind":"lyric"}],"candidates":[],"reviewStatus":"draft"}